# Raw capture and rendered video. "IG Posts" alone is 4.2GB and brand/motion is
# 167MB of exported stings — git stores every version of a binary forever, so
# one accidental `git add -A` would bloat the repo permanently. The clips the
# site actually serves are committed, optimised, under public/videos.
#
# Note what is NOT ignored: brand/logos and brand/Hat Logos are ~1.5MB of logo
# and merch artwork, and they belong in the repo. Ignoring brand/ wholesale
# would have hidden them.
IG Posts/
brand/motion/

